# 1. Ignore everything in train and val folders recursively
**/train/**/*
**/val/**/*

# 2. BUT do not ignore the subdirectories themselves (allows tracking structure)
!**/train/**/
!**/val/**/

# 3. BUT keep ignoring all images and caches
**/*.jpg
**/*.png
**/*.jpeg
*.cache

# 4. Explicitly ALLOW tracking .gitkeep files
!**/.gitkeep